# ============================================================
#  NYXUS — LOGIN-SCREEN wallpaper rotation set  (ALIEN THEME ONLY)
#  /usr/share/nyxus/wall-rotation.list   (read by nyxus-greeter)
#
#  The greeter runs as the `greeter` user and can only read system paths,
#  so this list uses slugs that exist as FLAT files under
#  /usr/share/backgrounds/nyxus/ (the greeter does not search rotation/).
#  Re-cut 2026-07-30 to the measured urban-alien style spec (HANDOFF: a
#  near-black frame, one blue->violet->magenta hue arc). Dropped that day:
#  graffiti-space (pop-art collage), demon (not an alien), and the
#  nyxus-graffiti-NN splatter set. Still excludes kageryu dragon,
#  sierengowski brand, and cinematic non-alien packs.
#
#  NOTE: nothing reads this today. nyxus-greeter stopped consulting it when
#  e5c381d1 pinned the login background to nyxus-urban-alien. It is kept
#  correct so that re-enabling rotation is a one-line change and not an
#  archaeology exercise — and because a list naming deleted files is exactly
#  how a blank login background gets shipped.
#  One slug per line; anything after '#' is a comment.
#  © 2026 JOSEPH A. SIERENGOWSKI · NYX-J5W-2026-SIERENGOWSKI-LOCKED
# ============================================================

nyxus-urban-alien           # the urban-alien street scene
nyxus-login-wall            # "NYXUS HYPRLAND CUSTOMS" alien shop
nyxus-desktop-hero          # NYXUS alien hero scene
